    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d469-a1">

                <pb facs="0579" n="471" xml:id="pg471"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">General Wheaton to
                        the Adjutant-General</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Antonio, Tex.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-11-20"><hi rendition="#italic">November 20,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your dispatch, this date received. Commanding officer at Old Fort Bliss had
                    already been ordered to confer with commanding officer Mexican troops at Juarez
                    and other Mexican officials. No information has as yet reached mo that any armed
                    party is assembling on our side to cross the Rio Grande. In-order to more
                    effectively guard the Upper Rio Grande, I recommend construction of barracks and
                    quarters for two troops of cavalry at New Fort Bliss.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Frank Wheaton</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Brigadier-General,
                    Commanding.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
